    "title": "Two convicted in 2022 fatal shooting in Newark - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n1 days ago NEWARK, NJ — A jury has convicted two defendants on charges stemming from a fatal shooting that occurred in Newark in 2022. Matthew Colon, 24, and Tashauna Hairston, both of Newark, were each found guilty of two counts of first-degree murder and two counts of first-degree conspiracy to commit murder. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 21",
